WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
[Instrumental music]
Room 905. A hotel door opens to reveal your crew.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Recovery and Guardian arrive at the trolley.
The Navigator takes their place in mission command.

00:18.000 --> 00:29.433
RECOVERY — Explore, carry fragile property,
and cross the parkour route.

00:29.433 --> 00:35.300
NAVIGATOR — See the hidden dangers.
Guide your crew from mission command.

00:35.300 --> 00:41.467
GUARDIAN — Track the Sentinel
and help protect the recovery crew.

00:41.467 --> 00:47.200
Return recovered property to the trolley.

00:47.200 --> 00:52.900
Customize your profile and invite your friends.

00:52.900 --> 00:56.400
The crew returns to the hotel lobby
with a loaded trolley.

00:56.400 --> 01:04.400
Your next shift. Room 905. Bring your crew.
[Music fades]
